<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Retribution Paladin Phase 2</h3>Even though there is a back available from <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="quest" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=13819/heroic-all-is-well-that-ends-well">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heroic: All Is Well That Ends Well</span></a>, its also going to reward one of your best rings for both 252 and non 252 setups, so you really can't ever use it.  Instead you're aiming for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46032/drape-of-the-faceless-general">
