<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="feet">Feet for Retribution Paladin Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45599/sabatons-of-lifeless-night">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sabatons of Lifeless Night</span></a> are just entirely too good to pass up.  With your pre-252 setup, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45564/footpads-of-silence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_leather01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Footpads of Silence</span></a> are a close second to these, and are very strong, and only a few dps behind <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45989/tempered-mercury-greaves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_chain_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tempered Mercury Greaves</span></a>.  It should be noted that if you need hit, the 239 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45989/tempered-mercury-greaves">
