<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Retribution Paladin Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=42987/darkmoon-card-greatness">
